---
import "../../styles/index.css";
import "../../styles/blog/blog.css";
import "../../styles/blog/history/history.css";

import image from "../../assets/favicon.png";
import rootme from "../../assets/rootme.png";

let lang = "fr";
const title = "First Website in Astrojs";
---
<html lang={lang}>
  <head>
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <link rel="icon" href={image.src} />
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <title>{title}</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <h1 style="color: rgb(4, 219, 4);">> Yanis Dubok's Website_</h1>

    <nav class="nav">
      <ul class="ul-list">
        <li class="nav-list">
          <a href="/">[ HOME ]</a>
        </li>
        <li class="nav-list">
          <a href="/blog/blog">[ BLOG ]</a>
        </li>
        <li class="nav-list">
          <a href="/project">[ SOON ]</a>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </nav>
    <hr>

    <main>
<article class="post">
  <header>
    <h2>I built my first website with Astro.</h2>

    <p class="meta">
      <time datetime="2026-08-05">August 05, 2026</time> |
      astro, web, html, css, javascript, portfolio
    </p>
  </header>

  <p>
    I decided to build my first real website using Astro.
  </p>

  <p>
    The goal was simple: create a fast, lightweight, and terminal-inspired
    personal website where I can share my projects, blog posts, and
    experiments.
  </p>

  <ul class="features">
    <li>🖥️ Built with Astro for speed and simplicity</li>
    <li>🎨 Custom retro terminal design inspired by Linux consoles</li>
    <li>📚 Dedicated blog to document my learning journey</li>
    <li>🚀 Optimized for performance and responsiveness</li>
    <li>🔧 Fully self-coded from scratch</li>
  </ul>

  <p>
    This is only the beginning. I'll continue improving the website by adding
    new features, projects, and articles as I learn new technologies.
  </p>

  <p>
    Thanks for visiting, and I hope you enjoy following my journey!
  </p>
  </article>

  <a href="https://github.com/kirobotdev/astro-first" id="cbxs">[ Code Website ]</a>
    </main>
        <hr id="hrrr">
        <footer>
          <span style="color: rgb(11, 204, 11);">></span>2026 - Yanis Dubok First Website in astro
        </footer>
  </body>
</html>